    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://biotime.st-andrews.ac.uk/>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch04-17--gpt--dataset-2> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/EvidenceItem>;
